Name: Argon2 reference implementation
URL: https://github.com/P-H-C/phc-winner-argon2
Version: N/A
Revision: 62358ba2123abd17fccf2a108a301d4b52c01a7c
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: src/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Official Argon2 reference C implementation, already pinned by brave/DEPS.
Alloy password profiles use Argon2id v1.3 through the existing scalar reference
target. The full upstream LICENSE and original author notices remain in src/.
Apache-2.0 is selected from the upstream Apache-2.0/CC0 choice.

Local Modifications:
None to upstream source. BUILD.gn additionally permits the Alloy site_records
consumer. ARGON2_NO_THREADS is retained; it changes scheduling, not lane count
or the Argon2 result.
